# Read by BuildKit for apps/store/Dockerfile instead of a root .dockerignore.
# The image needs the workspace manifests, the shared lint config, the design
# system and the packages it builds on, and this app.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
data
design
services
apps/cms
packages/met
packages/ui/storybook-static
packages/ui/.storybook
packages/ui/src/screens
**/*.stories.tsx
**/*.mdx
